  intr_exceptions_err_outside.pcpp - break step of intr_exceptions.pcpp:
  excmsg outside an except body (SM0615)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\intr_exceptions_err_outside.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\intr_exceptions_err_outside.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
